## SLOs

- Availability: 99.9% uptime
- Latency: p99 < 500ms for API endpoints
- Error rate: < 0.1%

## Failure Modes

- Database unavailable: return 503, retry with backoff
- External API unavailable: circuit breaker, cached fallback
- Memory pressure: shed load, return 429

## Observability

- Structured JSON logs with trace IDs
- Metrics: request rate, error rate, latency histograms
- Alerts on SLO breach

## Deployment

- Zero-downtime deploys (rolling or blue/green)
- Database migrations run before code deploy
- Rollback plan for each release
